==Release information==
The {{TCGP|Promo-A}} print of this card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 8 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Alolan Ninetales Drop Event]], which ran from May 16 to 26, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Toucannon|145}} from the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion.
*{{m|Beak Blast}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Toucannon}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

